# Round 77: SIMD alias/dependence bail parity. The TERM reads the
# buffer being written (out == an input), which the round-76 rule
# forbids for this recognizer family too -- the missing-cn compile
# error was MASKING the hole, and repairing the mangling without the
# bail would have been textbook silent-wrong (stale lanes). This
# shape demotes to the scalar path and must stay byte-exact.
# rowmap prefix chain: write base 1, read base 0 of the SAME buffer.
n is 12
b is buffer of n
i is 0
loop while i < n:
    b[i] is i * 10.0
    i is i + 1
m is n - 1
d is 0
loop while d < m:
    b[1 + d] is b[0 + d] + 1
    d is d + 1
j is 0
loop while j < n:
    print of b[j]
    j is j + 1
